Hi {seller_first},

A quick note to let you know that I am moving into a different area within {company} and will no longer be the main person looking after {product} on our side. It has been good working with you, and I want to make sure the conversation continues smoothly.

I will share my notes internally so whoever picks this up has the full picture. Expect to hear from them once the new arrangement is settled.

Kind regards,

{buyer_full}
{company}

Hi {seller_first},

I wanted to give you a heads-up that {company} is going through a restructure this quarter. Several teams are being combined, and some responsibilities, including ownership of the work we have been discussing on {product}, are being reassigned.

Once the new structure is confirmed I will let you know who your main contact will be. Until then, please bear with us if responses take a little longer than usual.

Best,

{buyer_full}
{company}

Hi {seller_first},

From here on, {other_name} will take the lead on {product} for {company} and has my full support to make decisions on the evaluation. Please work with {other_name} directly; there is no need to keep me in the loop on the day-to-day details.

Thank you for being so responsive so far. I am confident the project is in good hands.

Best regards,

{buyer_full}
{company}

Hi {seller_first},

I lead one of the business units at {company}, and after the recent changes here our group has been looking at {product} as well. The results the existing team reported caught our attention, and we would like to understand how it could support our work too.

Could you share what a rollout to another group typically involves and what the next steps would be? I would be glad to set up a short call with the right people.

Kind regards,

{buyer_full}
{company}

Hi {seller_first},

I have recently joined the conversations about {product} at {company} and wanted to introduce myself. I will be helping the team assess how it fits with our current setup, so you can expect a few questions from me over the coming weeks.

Looking forward to working with you.

Best,

{buyer_full}
{company}
